ty outcome or admitted Core/MIR. Missing review can reject, and audit-only records without an approval gate. Imported certificate/unsafe summaries refer to already-built dependency packages Q; current package P emits its own local safety products before its later packaging. P's own published certificate is never its classification input. Additional SAFE2-SAFE5 classification consumes complete specialized access/initialization/alias/lifetime/region/generation/linear/transfer facts and obligations, exact current profile/provider availability and existing subject-bound proof/audit decisions. Bind each permitted dynamic check to the operation, attached state, emitted identity/location, declared failure and introduced effects before violation; actual check/failure execution remains later evidence. Missing dynamic machinery requires the specific source rule's proof or refusal, with an explicit audited unsafe alternative only where that rule and profile/mode policy permit it. SAFE3 normal-borrow and SAFE4 safe arena-use refusals survive. Unsafe candidates and supplied verdicts confer neither a fifth outcome nor accepted MIR; existing required specialist review remains separate from audit-only records.",
